OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Fcloudy and dry this evening and
OL,7,Fovernight with only very isolated
OL,8,Fclear spells. Winds easing to a light
OL,9,Fbreeze, but feeling chilly. The odd
OL,10,Fpatch of light rain possible by dawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FAnother cloudy day, with fewer
OL,13,Fbright breaks than on Thursday.
OL,14,FRemaining dry for most, though patches
OL,15,Fof light rain may break out at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
